== Usage ==
=== Private Island ===
'''Sticky Pistons''' can be placed as a decorative block on the player's {{Zone|Private Island}} or plots in {{Zone|The Garden}}. However, like {{Item|Piston}}s, they cannot be activated from [[Redstone]].

